d 'XTPQGMM': module to estimate GMM panel data quantile model
d
d  xtpqgmm fits the smoothed profiled GMM estimator for panel data
d quantile regression with individual fixed effects and endogenous
d regressors proposed by Galvao, Hounyo and Lin (2026), "GMM for
d panel data quantile regression", arXiv:2610.12824. The fixed
d effects are profiled out rather than estimated jointly, the
d indicator function is smoothed with a fourth-order kernel, and
d the standard errors are HAC (Bartlett) within unit. The exactly
d identified method-of-moments variant and the one-step estimator
d are also available. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: quantile regression
d KW: GMM
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtpqgmm.ado
f xtpqgmm.sthlp
f ../l/lxtpqgmm.mlib
f xtpqgmm_estat.ado
f xtpqgmm_methods.sthlp
f xtpqgmm_p.ado
f xtpqgmm_postestimation.sthlp
f xtpqgmmplot.ado
f xtpqgmmplot.sthlp
